@sheet Data
@header | Amount | Qty |
| 5 | 2 |
| 9 | 1 |
| 6 | 3 |

@sheet Summary
@header | Metric | Value |
[bold] | Total sales | =SUM(!!Amount) |
[italic] | Total units | =SUM(!!Qty) |
[bg:#fef3c7] | Carry | =B2+B3 |

@sheet Review
@header | Check | Value |
| Final | =Summary!B4 |
| Delta | =Summary!B2-Summary!B3 |
